msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Izumi-chan over at the Morning Glory Orphanage is the same age as you, but "
"she's so polite and always has a smile on her face. You should be more like "
"her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Izumi? Smiling? No way. She's a total mope, and she never stops fidgeting. "
"Maybe if she had parents, she wouldn't be such a weirdo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Tadashi, how could you!? She lost her parents in a terrible accident, the "
"poor thing! You be nice to her! You hear me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Aww... But I don't wanna..."
msgstr ""

